## State

[Zustand](https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand) example store at `src/store/useStore.ts` (demoed by `src/components/CounterDemo.tsx`). Add your own state as a new store, one `create()` call per slice:

```ts
// src/store/useUserPrefs.ts
import { create } from "zustand";

interface UserPrefsState {
  theme: "light" | "dark";
  setTheme: (theme: "light" | "dark") => void;
}

export const useUserPrefs = create<UserPrefsState>((set) => ({
  theme: "light",
  setTheme: (theme) => set({ theme }),
}));
```

```tsx
